                                "sense_id": "242a31d4-d1e9-35f7-a6e0-2d2481030ce4",
                                "text": "As for whores—they are sometimes daughters of fine homes peddling their quim and quiff for a thumbnail of cocaine or a tot of rot-gut whiskey."
                            },
